# kinopub-gui
===
 Desktop-grade web GUI for kino.pub — browse the full catalog, preview titles in a built-in player, and download full-fidelity video (every audio track & subtitle, whole series) with live progress. Official kino.pub API; single Go binary with an embedded React UI.
